" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>跳跃的，斑驳的，穿刺的，直击骨髓的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我的，你的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>未来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:111%\">空的。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:138%\">空的？</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><br /><br /><span style=\"color:#CC0000\"><span style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:138%\">空的。</span></span></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"color:#CC0000\"><span style=\"text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:138%\">空的，空的——空的！</span></span></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br />                 <span style=\"color:#CC0000\"><span style=\"font-size:138%\">空的。</span></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"color:#CC0000\"><span style=\"font-size:138%\">空的。</span></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……咕……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>咕咚、咕噜噜……咕、嗵、嗵……嗵嗵嗵嗵——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>啪——！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsib